rooms_desc ({"The room has been modeled after the bridge to the Improbability Drivedriven starship Heart of Gold, complete with cardboard cutouts of Marvin and the rest of the crew just before they turned some nuclear warheadsinto orbiting sperm whales. You check yourself to make sure you are still yourself, and not a penguinor something.","Look's like any other room, except that this one is exceptional in it's total lack of tasteful decor. Not that it is in BAD taste, but rather it is so utterly plain and simple that a sense of dullness pervadesyou're soul. You find yourself wanting to leave this room very badly.","You are the void. There is nothing here. Try to swim back west, quick!",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
